{"How many? Do not count. Look for the five.":[0,14637],"Pack the ones in tens. Then say how many there are.":[14637,17373],"How many are there?":[32010,5853],"How many blocks do you see?":[37863,8733],"Where is the puppy? Which number?":[46596,10605],"Find the mystery number.":[57201,7581],"Race to one hundred. Who do you want to play with?":[64782,16077],"Your turn. Spin!":[80859,7437],"The puppy's turn. Spin!":[88296,9165],"The grown-up's turn. Spin!":[97461,9741],"Where do you land?":[107202,5853],"Where does the puppy land?":[113055,7725],"Where does the grown-up land?":[120780,8301],"All taken away. How many are left?":[129081,12477],"He eats 10 of them.":[141558,6861],"The puppy wants 10 bones.":[148419,9165],"How many bones does he have now?":[157584,10461],"How many bones are left?":[168045,8157],"How many more does he need?":[176202,8157],"How many bones can he still see?":[184359,10317],"You just saw it!":[194676,5565],"5. One whole hand!":[200241,8445],"5 and 5 make 10. Two whole hands!":[208686,15213],"Only the tens change.":[223899,8157],"Only the tens change. The ones stay the same.":[232056,16221],"The same friends of ten.":[248277,8157],"The ones filled up a ten.":[256434,8157],"First fill the ten, then add the rest.":[264591,13053],"You broke a ten to get more ones.":[277644,9885],"What a race! Play again?":[287529,8445],"You won the race!":[295974,6141],"Keep packing!":[302115,5421],"Yes! Keep going.":[307536,7005],"Ten ones! They pack into a ten.":[314541,11469],"Not enough left for a ten. They stay ones.":[326010,14637],"One ten is now 10 ones.":[340647,9597],"Try again.":[350244,4989],"Count the red tens along the line: 10, 20, 30. Then add the blue ones.":[355233,28749],"That is not far enough yet.":[383982,9165],"That is too far. Go back to the start.":[393147,13197],"Look at the blocks. Tap where they end.":[406344,12477],"Not quite. Count the tens along the line: 10, 20, 30.":[418821,23277],"Change only the tens. The ones stay the same.":[442098,16077],"Fill the ten first. Then add the rest.":[458175,13197],"Take the tens away first, then the ones. Use the blocks if you like.":[471372,22989],"Ten on: go one row down. The ones stay the same.":[494361,18381],"Do not count them all. The top row is 5. How many more?":[512742,19821],"Do not count them all. The dark blue ones are 5. How many more?":[532563,21981],"That is not enough yet.":[554544,8301],"That is too many. Start again.":[562845,10749],"Count the red tens: 10, 20, 30. Then add the ones.":[573594,21981],"Do not count every block. Count the red tens in tens: 10, 20, 30. Then add the blue ones.":[595575,37821],"Count the empty places, or the fingers that are down.":[633396,17661],"Count the empty places in the blue tower.":[651057,13053],"Watch the yellow ones fill up the ten. Now count the tens.":[664110,19677],"Look at the blue tower. The yellow ones fit in the empty places.":[683787,21981],"The tens stay. Just add the ones.":[705768,11757],"You have taken all the tens.":[717525,9309],"You have taken all the ones.":[726834,8877],"No ones left! Break a ten into 10 ones.":[735711,15501],"You have enough ones. No need to break a ten.":[751212,15069],"Count what is left. Red tens in tens: 10, 20, 30. Then the blue ones.":[766281,30765],"The parts together are as long as the whole. What is missing?":[797046,19677],"The mystery number is the whole. Put the two parts together.":[816723,18525],"Take the part away from the whole. Only the tens change.":[835248,18381],"The ones are the same. How many tens are gone?":[853629,14637],"Ten more is one more ten. The ones stay the same.":[868266,17517],"Ten fewer is one ten gone. The ones stay the same.":[885783,18957],"Think of the friends of ten.":[904740,8301],"The ones are the same. How many tens are missing?":[913041,15213],"Take the tens away first, then the ones.":[928254,13197],"All done for today!":[941451,7149],"Good trying!":[948600,4845],"Still great at this one.":[953445,8013],"You finished this game! The puppy is proud of you.":[961458,15213],"One more good round like this and the game is finished.":[976671,16221],"Next time we start with an easier level.":[992892,13629],"A new best time!":[1006521,6429],"That is your first best time.":[1012950,9453],"Slow down a little and get them right first.":[1022403,14061],"Time to stop. See you tomorrow!":[1036464,11469],"Ready for the next one?":[1047933,7869],"Sound on!":[1055802,4557],"Yes!":[1060359,3693],"Well done!":[1064052,4557],"Great!":[1068609,3981],"You got it!":[1072590,4989],"Super!":[1077579,3837],"That's right!":[1081416,4989],"Brilliant!":[1086405,4557],"Nice one!":[1090962,4989],"There you go!":[1095951,4557],"Now you have it!":[1100508,6285],"Good, you found it!":[1106793,6429],"0 is 0 tens and 0 ones.":[1113222,14925],"1 is 0 tens and 1 one.":[1128147,11037],"2 is 0 tens and 2 ones.":[1139184,11325],"3 is 0 tens and 3 ones.":[1150509,11469],"4 is 0 tens and 4 ones.":[1161978,12477],"5 is 0 tens and 5 ones.":[1174455,12765],"6 is 0 tens and 6 ones.":[1187220,12765],"7 is 0 tens and 7 ones.":[1199985,14061],"8 is 0 tens and 8 ones.":[1214046,12333],"9 is 0 tens and 9 ones.":[1226379,13485],"10 is 1 ten and 0 ones.":[1239864,11469],"11 is 1 ten and 1 one.":[1251333,12189],"12 is 1 ten and 2 ones.":[1263522,10461],"13 is 1 ten and 3 ones.":[1273983,12477],"14 is 1 ten and 4 ones.":[1286460,12477],"15 is 1 ten and 5 ones.":[1298937,12333],"16 is 1 ten and 6 ones.":[1311270,12621],"17 is 1 ten and 7 ones.":[1323891,13917],"18 is 1 ten and 8 ones.":[1337808,11757],"19 is 1 ten and 9 ones.":[1349565,12045],"20 is 2 tens and 0 ones.":[1361610,13053],"21 is 2 tens and 1 one.":[1374663,12333],"22 is 2 tens and 2 ones.":[1386996,12189],"23 is 2 tens and 3 ones.":[1399185,13341],"24 is 2 tens and 4 ones.":[1412526,13053],"25 is 2 tens and 5 ones.":[1425579,14205],"26 is 2 tens and 6 ones.":[1439784,13197],"27 is 2 tens and 7 ones.":[1452981,15357],"28 is 2 tens and 8 ones.":[1468338,13053],"29 is 2 tens and 9 